1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,913
George Washington didn't go
home for more than six years.

2
00:00:04,173 --> 00:00:09,673
In May 1775 he rode out of Mount
Vernon for Congress in Philadelphia.

3
00:00:09,723 --> 00:00:12,456
Six weeks later he was commanding an army.

4
00:00:12,766 --> 00:00:16,636
Pull his home out of the rest of
his life, and there's the gap.

5
00:00:16,686 --> 00:00:20,766
Boston, New York, the Delaware, Valley
Forge. Six years and four months,

6
00:00:20,816 --> 00:00:22,690
and not one night at home.

7
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:25,300
He finally rode in on
the march to Yorktown,

8
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:28,088
stayed three nights, and
left to win the war.

9
00:00:28,338 --> 00:00:32,248
His whole life, every date with
its source. That's OpenChronology,

10
00:00:32,298 --> 00:00:33,637
and it's free.
